FoxesLauncher（狐狐启动器）是基于 Plain Craft Launcher 2 (PCL2) 的第三方分支，
由终章 EndlessMC 组织（EndlessMC Organization）维护。

This project is a third-party fork of Plain Craft Launcher 2 (PCL2),
maintained by the EndlessMC Organization.

